{"seq":1,"slug":"peg-packrat","title":"PEG 与 Packrat","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/advanced/peg-packrat","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"peg-与-packrat\">PEG 与 Packrat</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">上下文无关文法</a> 有个挥之不去的毛病：它的「或」（<code>|</code>）是无序的集合，于是 <code>if E then S | if E then S else S</code> 这种写法天生二义，要靠外部约定消歧。2004 年 Bryan Ford 提出的解析表达文法（Parsing Expression Grammar，PEG）从根上换了个思路：把「或」改成有序选择，规则从「描述一个语言」变成「描述一台识别器怎么一步步匹配」。它定义上就无二义，代价是有自己的怪脾气。配套的 Packrat 解析则用记忆化，把 PEG 朴素实现的指数回溯压成线性时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PEG 和 CFG 长得像，但语义全然不同。最关键的区别是有序选择 <code>e1 / e2</code>：先试 <code>e1</code>，<strong>只有 <code>e1</code> 失败才试 <code>e2</code></strong>，一旦 <code>e1</code> 成功就提交、绝不回头看 <code>e2</code>。对比 CFG 的 <code>e1 | e2</code> 是「两条都可能，谁都行」，PEG 的 <code>/</code> 是「优先 <code>e1</code>，<code>e2</code> 只是后备」。这一个改动直接消灭了二义性——任何输入在任何规则下都只有唯一一种匹配结果。</p>\n<p>PEG 还有两个 CFG 没有的算子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>顺序谓词 <code>&amp;e</code>（and-predicate）：测试 <code>e</code> 能否匹配，但<strong>不消耗输入</strong>，匹配成功才继续。</li>\n<li>否定谓词 <code>!e</code>（not-predicate）：测试 <code>e</code> 匹配不上才继续，同样不消耗输入。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;规则 A = e1 / e2 / e3&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;在当前位置试 e1&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|成功| C[&quot;提交 e1 结果&lt;br/&gt;不再看 e2 e3&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|失败| D[&quot;回退到原位置 试 e2&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|成功| E[&quot;提交 e2 结果&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|失败| F[&quot;回退 试 e3&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|全失败| G[&quot;规则 A 失败&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"规则 A = e1 / e2 / e3\"] --&gt; B[\"在当前位置试 e1\"]\n  B --&gt;|成功| C[\"提交 e1 结果&lt;br/&gt;不再看 e2 e3\"]\n  B --&gt;|失败| D[\"回退到原位置 试 e2\"]\n  D --&gt;|成功| E[\"提交 e2 结果\"]\n  D --&gt;|失败| F[\"回退 试 e3\"]\n  F --&gt;|全失败| G[\"规则 A 失败\"]</pre><p>有了 <code>!e</code>，PEG 能轻松表达「最长匹配的注释」「不跨越关键字的标识符」这类在 CFG 里很别扭的约束——它本质是带回溯与前瞻断言的 <a href=\"../top-down/recursive-descent\">递归下降</a> 的形式化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有序选择如何消歧\">有序选择如何消歧</h2><p>有序选择最直接的红利，是悬空 else 不再是问题。在 CFG 里这是经典二义；在 PEG 里只要把「带 else 的」写在前面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Stmt &lt;- &#39;if&#39; Expr &#39;then&#39; Stmt &#39;else&#39; Stmt&#10;      / &#39;if&#39; Expr &#39;then&#39; Stmt&#10;      / Other\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Stmt &#x3C;- 'if' Expr 'then' Stmt 'else' Stmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      / 'if' Expr 'then' Stmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      / Other</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解析 <code>if a then if b then c else d</code> 时，里层 if 优先尝试「带 else」的分支，<code>else</code> 自然配到最近的 if——规则顺序直接定义了语义，无需任何外部约定。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">上下文无关文法</a> 那节里「换一种从定义上无二义的体系」所指的方案。</p>\n<p>但有序选择也有暗坑：它会<strong>悄悄吞掉</strong>你以为还在的歧义。<code>A &lt;- a / ab</code> 永远匹配不到 <code>ab</code>，因为 <code>a</code> 总是先成功、提交后就不试 <code>ab</code> 了。在 CFG 里这是良性的二义，在 PEG 里它变成一个静默的逻辑错误——你写的第二个分支永远是死代码。顺序敏感是 PEG 的双刃剑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"packrat-用记忆化换线性时间\">Packrat：用记忆化换线性时间</h2><p>PEG 的有序选择意味着大量回溯：<code>e1</code> 试到一半失败，回退再试 <code>e2</code>，同一段输入可能被不同规则反复解析。朴素实现最坏是指数时间——和回溯式 <a href=\"../top-down/recursive-descent\">递归下降</a>、朴素 <a href=\"../top-down/parser-combinators\">解析器组合子</a> 同一个病根。</p>\n<p>Packrat 解析用一个简单而有力的观察治好它：在 PEG 里，「规则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在输入位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的匹配结果」是确定且唯一的（拜有序选择所赐），所以算一次就能缓存。Packrat 用一张记忆表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>规则</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>位置</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[\\text{规则}, \\text{位置}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">规则</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位置</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 存下每个（规则,位置）的结果，再遇到就直接查表。每个组合只算一次，总时间降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>规则数</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\times |规则数|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">规则数</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即对固定文法是线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。落地成代码，就是在朴素匹配外面包一层缓存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 记忆表: (规则, 位置) -&gt; 结果, 结果因有序选择而唯一, 故缓存永远安全&#10;match(rule, pos):&#10;  if (rule, pos) in memo: return memo[rule, pos]&#10;  r = 朴素匹配(rule, pos)        // 内部仍是有序选择 + 回溯&#10;  memo[(rule, pos)] = r&#10;  return r\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 记忆表: (规则, 位置) -> 结果, 结果因有序选择而唯一, 故缓存永远安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>match(rule, pos):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (rule, pos) in memo: return memo[rule, pos]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  r = 朴素匹配(rule, pos)        // 内部仍是有序选择 + 回溯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  memo[(rule, pos)] = r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return r</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代价是空间：记忆表与输入长度成正比，最坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 空间且常数不小，解析大文件时内存占用可观。下表把 PEG/Packrat 放进本 hub 的方法谱系对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>PEG/Packrat</th>\n<th>LL(1)</th>\n<th>LALR(1)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二义性</td>\n<td>定义上无（有序选择）</td>\n<td>文法须无冲突</td>\n<td>靠优先级声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（Packrat）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（记忆表）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 栈深</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 栈深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左递归</td>\n<td>不支持（需特殊扩展）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词法/语法</td>\n<td>可合一（scannerless）</td>\n<td>通常分离</td>\n<td>通常分离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 PEG 常做成无扫描器（scannerless）——直接在字符上解析，不要独立的 <a href=\"../foundations/lexical-analysis\">词法分析</a> 阶段，因为 <code>!e</code> 谓词足以表达最长匹配这类原本属于词法的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"左递归这个死穴\">左递归这个死穴</h2><p>PEG 最大的硬伤和 <a href=\"../top-down/recursive-descent\">递归下降</a> 一模一样：不支持左递归。<code>Expr &lt;- Expr &#39;+&#39; Term / Term</code> 会让解析器在位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 解析 <code>Expr</code> 时立刻又去位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 解析 <code>Expr</code>，无限递归——Packrat 的记忆表此时还没填好结果，救不了它。</p>\n<p>应对有几条路。最常见的是和递归下降一样改写成重复：<code>Expr &lt;- Term (&#39;+&#39; Term)*</code>，但这会让 <a href=\"../foundations/parse-trees-ast\">AST</a> 形状变成扁平列表，需要后处理成左结合树。更彻底的是采用支持左递归的 Packrat 扩展（Warth 等人 2008 年提出的「seed-growing」算法），让记忆表迭代地「种子生长」出左递归结果——一些现代 PEG 库已内建此能力。还有不少实现干脆把表达式优先级交给 <a href=\"../bottom-up/operator-precedence\">Pratt 解析</a>，让 PEG 只管其余结构。</p>\n<p>这套技术今天活跃在真实世界：Python 自 3.9 起官方解析器换成了 PEG（取代旧的 LL(1)），就是看中它对复杂语法的表达力和有序选择的确定性；众多配置语言、DSL、Markdown 类解析器也建在 PEG 之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PEG 用有序选择 <code>/</code>（提交即不回头）取代 CFG 无序的 <code>|</code>，从定义上消除二义性，并补充 <code>&amp;e</code>/<code>!e</code> 两个不消耗输入的前瞻谓词。</li>\n<li>有序选择让悬空 else 等二义靠规则顺序自然消解，但也会静默吞掉被前面分支遮蔽的分支，需警惕顺序敏感。</li>\n<li>Packrat 用记忆表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>规则</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>位置</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[\\text{规则},\\text{位置}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">规则</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位置</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 缓存每个组合的唯一结果，把朴素 PEG 的指数回溯压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 空间。</li>\n<li>PEG 不支持左递归（与递归下降同病），靠改写成重复、seed-growing 扩展或交给 Pratt 解决；Python 3.9+ 官方解析器即采用 PEG。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PEG 与 Packrat","id":"peg-与-packrat"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"有序选择如何消歧","id":"有序选择如何消歧"},{"level":2,"text":"Packrat：用记忆化换线性时间","id":"packrat-用记忆化换线性时间"},{"level":2,"text":"左递归这个死穴","id":"左递归这个死穴"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"算符优先与 Pratt 解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/bottom-up/operator-precedence"},"next":{"title":"错误恢复与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/advanced/error-recovery"}}